=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wailing_Widow_s_Necklace_40ec77.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Amulet\"><img alt=\"Platinum Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Amulet_942298.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Beetle Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beetle_Necklace_e2c325.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Hammer\"><img alt=\"War Hammer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/War_Hammer_4ee839.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.60<br/>June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Brimstone Bug Caves</b> are two separate caves populated by <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\">Brimstone Bugs</a>, hence their names. One of them can be found in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Zao%20Plantations\">Northern Zao Plantations</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33219,31100,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33219, 31100, 7)</a> and the other in the northern part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33294,31139,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33294, 31139, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>It might be a good idea to bring some <a href=\"#/wiki/Bronze%20Amulet\">Bronze Amulets</a> to your hunt, as <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug\">Brimstone Bugs</a> can drain your mana really quickly when in larger groups.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in the northern cave</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Toad\"><img alt=\"Toad\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Toad_48df3d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Toad\">Toad</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">60</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">135</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">48 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">30 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">18 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-20× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Poisonous Slime (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Hammer\">War Hammer</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lancer%20Beetle\"><img alt=\"Lancer Beetle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lancer_Beetle_c1d791.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Lancer%20Beetle\">Lancer Beetle</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">275</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">290?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-130× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Lancer Beetle Shell (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Poisonous Slime (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Dirt\">Lump of Dirt</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Beetle Necklace (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wailing%20Widow\"><img alt=\"Wailing Widow\" cl